{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーんっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/26/img_4849.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やせうま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな！これが！\nこれがやせうまだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方からも\nメンバーからも\nやせうまっち何？？？\nっち聞かれてたんやけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の話かわからない方は、\n第一回目のお見立て会で\nみさの大好物と紹介した\n大分の郷土料理なんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい先日、大分に少し\n帰省したんですけど\nその時に食べたんよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい時から大好きな\n別府の『甘味茶屋』という\nお店です(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分県民の方、または\n大分に行く機会がある方\nぜひ行ってみてください♪\nみさのおすすめNO.1だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして〜\nみんなコメントたくさん\nありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつ\nゆっくり読みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリームシチュー\n食べたいってゆってくれて\n嬉しいよ(=゜ω゜)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世辞でも嬉しわ(T^T)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさもみんなにも\n作ってあげたいしっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな機会あるかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に、もしあったときは\nみんな食べてくれる？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとコロコロもっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔の表情筋？を鍛えれば\nいいみたいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなアドバイスありがとう☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今も、コロコロなうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しすぎには\n注意しまーす(´･ω･｀)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って痩せるぞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"30日のZEEP東京でのイベント\nもう発表されたみたいですが\nみなさんどうでしたかっ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"30日まであと4日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日もあるよ〜〜〜(><)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いよ〜\nみんなに会えるまで4日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から緊張していますが\nイベントまであと少し、\n練習にも\nより気合いが入ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるの\n楽しみに待っています☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のリハーサルも\n頑張るよっ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回お会いできない方\nまた次の機会で\n必ずお会い出来ると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからその時まで\n待っててくださいね(>_<｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし。明日も１日頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ\nお休みなさいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！\n質問とかも受け付けるので\nよろしくお願いしますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ今日の綺麗な夕日で\nお休みなさいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/26/img_6747.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗でしょ？"}],"source":"archive"}